=== Liberal ===
Andrew Cuomo was nominated by the Liberal Party before his withdrawal from the race, and his withdrawal came too late for his name to be removed from the Liberal Party line.<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.nytimes.com/2002/09/24/nyregion/cuomo-will-remain-on-ballot-as-liberal-party-candidate.html|title=Cuomo Will Remain on Ballot As Liberal Party Candidate|first=Randal |last=Archibold|date=September 24, 2002|via=NYTimes.com}}</ref>

